  "body": "Tucked away at the end of a peaceful, family-friendly cul-de-sac in sought-after Manly, this solid, low-maintenance home offers the relaxed Hibiscus Coast lifestyle you have been waiting for. Designed for effortless, easy-care living with durable low-maintenance cladding, this sunny north-facing property captures all-day warmth, natural light, and tranquil park views with a peep of the sea!\r\n\r\nInside, the home is neat as a pin and full of character. Beautiful white-painted sarked ceilings elevate the main living area, creating a wonderful sense of light, height, and coastal charm. Offering more space than meets the eye, the layout features three generous double bedrooms including a spacious master suite with seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nStep outside onto the expansive, full-length north-facing deck, the prime spot for summer entertaining, weekend BBQs, or relaxing to native birdsong while watching the kids walk safely through neighbouring Manly Park on their way to school, or enjoy a quiet evening on the private and covered back outdoor entertaining deck. \r\n\r\nProperty Highlights & Key Features:\r\n\r\n• Solid & Easy-Care: Reliable solid construction with durable, low-maintenance cladding, giving you more time to enjoy the Coast.\r\n\r\n• All-Day Sun: Prime north-facing orientation flooding the living spaces and full-length deck with natural light.\r\nSpacious Accommodation: Three genuine double bedrooms, including a generous master opening directly to the outdoors.\r\n\r\n• Character & Light: High painted sarked ceilings and timber walls, enhancing space and coastal charm\r\n\r\n• Unbeatable Family Location: Quiet cul-de-sac position bordering Manly Park, within easy walking distance to local schools, Whangaparaoa College, Manly Village shops, and public transport.\r\n\r\n• Coastal Recreation at Your Doorstep: Minutes from Big Manly Beach, Little Manly Beach, the sailing club, netball courts, tennis club, and bowling club.\r\n\r\n• Ready Now: Vacant possession with immediate settlement available - move in ready so you or tenants can be settled in time for Christmas!\r\n\r\nAfter more than 15 years of cherished ownership, our realistic and motivated vendors are ready to pass this affordable Manly address on to its next lucky family, first-home buyer, or smart investor.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this opportunity to secure a solid, sunny foothold on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula. Join us at this weekend’s Open Home or call today to arrange your private viewing",
